  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women as change agents for Peace</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project provides high-level technical guidance on gender-responsive peace and security initiatives to benefit the dynamic ecosystem of peace advocacy in Pakistan, contributing to stability in Afghanistan and the region. Firstly, it will support placing a senior local expert at the office of the special peace envoy in Pakistan. Secondly, it will facilitate the engagement of academia from the region and beyond to catalyze discussion on chosen topics, emphasized on track -II dialogues. The academic conferences will be compiled to serve as reference material for future peace processes</narrative>
  </description>
